      "correlation": "Branches share a family prefix and correlated latent wait/cancellation draws. Shared physical state also couples otherwise unrelated sessions through capacity. Bootstrap whole runs, never individual requests or branches.",
      "regressions": "Report scenario-specific p95 differences and secondary memory, transfer, recomputation, and canceled-owner encoding changes, including adverse outcomes. Do not select scenarios or seeds after viewing evaluation results.",
