      "forecast_inputs": "Pause events contain only current size, compatibility namespace, estimated recomputation cost, pause kind, and time. Actual future duration and cancellation appear only as later terminal events.",
      "family_identity": "Family and branch indices appear only within ordinary session IDs and shared block hashes; there is no additional family_id, future_probability, or outcome field in pause events. These identifiers do not determine future outcomes."
